        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Hampton Del Ruth, Ted Kotcheff, Alfred J. Goulding, Harry McCoy, Earle Rodney, Mack Sennett\n- Films: Girl Crazy (1929 film)\n- Roles: film actor, director, screenwriter, film producer, television director, producer\n\nFacts:\n- Hampton Del Ruth was born on September 7, 1879, and he was an American film actor, director, screenwriter, and film producer.\n- Ted Kotcheff was born on April 7, 1931, as Velichko Todorov Tsochev, and he is a Bulgarian-Canadian film and television director and producer.\n- Ted Kotcheff is known primarily for his work on high-profile British and American television productions such as \"Armchair Theatre.\"\n- Hampton Del Ruth, Alfred J. Goulding, Harry McCoy, Earle Rodney, and Mack Sennett received story credit for Girl Crazy (1929 film).\n- Hampton Del Ruth died on May 15, 1958.",
